WEBVTT

00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:08.997
- [growls]
- Hey!

00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:16.135
[growls]

00:00:18.877 --> 00:00:21.880
- [roars]
- [grunts]

00:00:26.014 --> 00:00:28.103
[Toothless purrs]

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:37.156
- [dragon snarls]
- [Snotlout] Whoa!

00:00:39.898 --> 00:00:42.074
[sniffing]

00:00:48.863 --> 00:00:50.865
I've never seen
a Gronckle do that.

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:53.085
I left my axe
back in the ring.

00:00:53.259 --> 00:00:56.044
You guys go on ahead.
I'll catch up with you.

00:00:57.655 --> 00:01:01.049
[guttural growls]

00:01:02.747 --> 00:01:03.922
[gurgle]

00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:11.886
- Hyah!
- [roars]

00:01:14.802 --> 00:01:16.151
[Astrid yells]

00:01:24.943 --> 00:01:27.206
[clamoring]

00:01:35.693 --> 00:01:38.130
[Gobber] Meet
the Terrible Terror.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.003
[scoffs] It's like
the size of my...

00:01:42.177 --> 00:01:44.571
- [crowd groans]
- [Tuffnut] Get it off!
[groans]

00:01:44.745 --> 00:01:49.054
Oh, I'm hurt!
I am very much hurt!

00:01:49.228 --> 00:01:52.144
- [grunts]
- Wow! He's better
than you ever were.

00:01:55.843 --> 00:01:57.280
[grunting]

00:02:10.945 --> 00:02:12.033
[groans]

00:02:12.904 --> 00:02:15.733
[purrs, growls]

00:02:37.276 --> 00:02:39.278
[Hiccup] Oh, great.

00:02:39.452 --> 00:02:40.888
Hiccup.

00:02:53.858 --> 00:02:55.338
[metal clatters]

00:02:56.339 --> 00:02:58.950
[Astrid] Hiccup?
Are you in there?

00:03:00.168 --> 00:03:01.344
Astrid. Hey.

00:03:01.518 --> 00:03:04.303
Hi, Astrid. Hi, Astrid.
Hi, Astrid.

00:03:04.477 --> 00:03:07.262
I normally don't care
what people do,
but you're acting weird.

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:10.178
- Ohh! [nervous chuckle]
- Well, weirder.

00:03:19.318 --> 00:03:22.190
- [sea birds cawing]
- [Vikings moaning]

00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:40.644
I trust you found
the nest, at least?

00:03:40.818 --> 00:03:42.254
Not even close.

00:03:42.428 --> 00:03:44.212
Oh. Excellent.

00:03:44.387 --> 00:03:46.389
I hope you had
more success than me.

00:03:46.563 --> 00:03:50.915
If by success, you mean
your parenting troubles
are over, yes.

00:03:51.089 --> 00:03:54.658
Congratulations, Stoick!
Everyone is so relieved!

00:03:54.832 --> 00:03:56.921
Out with the old
and in with the new, right?

00:03:57.095 --> 00:03:58.226
No one will miss
that nuisance!

00:03:58.401 --> 00:03:59.967
We're throwing a party
to celebrate!

00:04:00.141 --> 00:04:01.926
- Come over here.
- Hurry!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.145
He's gone?

00:04:04.319 --> 00:04:07.192
Yeah. Most afternoons,
but who can blame him?

00:04:07.366 --> 00:04:09.803
The life of a celebrity
is very rough.

00:04:09.977 --> 00:04:13.198
He can barely walk through
the village without being
swarmed by his new fans.

00:04:13.372 --> 00:04:15.287
- Hiccup?
- Who would have
thought it, eh?

00:04:15.461 --> 00:04:18.333
He has this way
with the beasts.

00:04:26.603 --> 00:04:30.128
OK, bud. We're gonna
take this nice and slow.

00:04:30.302 --> 00:04:32.826
Here we go. Here we go.
Position...

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.089
...three... no, four.

00:04:54.457 --> 00:04:56.023
All right, it's go time.
It's go time.

00:04:56.197 --> 00:04:58.025
[Toothless growls]

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.858
Come on, buddy!
Come on, buddy!

00:05:12.997 --> 00:05:14.477
Yes, it worked!

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.483
- [growls]
- Sorry!

00:05:21.919 --> 00:05:24.269
- [growls]
- It was my fault.

00:05:25.444 --> 00:05:29.100
Yeah, I'm on it.
Position four. Uh, three.

00:05:32.059 --> 00:05:34.235
Yeah! Go, baby!

00:05:34.888 --> 00:05:35.846
Yes!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.456
Oh, this is amazing!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.763
The wind in my...
cheat sheet!

00:05:39.937 --> 00:05:42.243
Stop!

00:05:44.507 --> 00:05:46.813
- No!
- [roars]

00:05:49.294 --> 00:05:52.906
Oh, gosh!
Oh, gods! Oh, no!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:56.083
All right, OK, you've gotta
kind of angle yourself.

00:05:56.257 --> 00:05:59.347
OK, no, no, no. Come back down
towards me! Come back down...
Ow!

00:06:05.658 --> 00:06:07.181
[roars]

00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:17.278
[shrieks]

